      en: ["The Cairngorms is the largest national park in the UK, at 4,528 square kilometers.", "Ben Macdui is the highest peak in the park at 1,309 meters (4,295 feet).", "The park is home to 25% of the UK's rare and endangered species.", "Balmoral Castle has been a residence of the British Royal Family since 1852.", "It contains the only free-ranging herd of reindeer in the United Kingdom.", "The park features three of Scotland's five ski centers."],
